### Base Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@subjectId = 44bb7f74-f4c0-4b36-9e4e-50cb6332f6de

### 1. Get All Subjects
GET {{baseUrl}}/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get Single Subject by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Create a New Subject
POST {{baseUrl}}/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Computer Science",
  "category": "Technology",
  "description": "Learn algorithms, data structures, and web development."
}